stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Disconnected

    Disconnected --> FetchingTicket : User visits /app
    FetchingTicket --> Connecting : Single-use ticket received (TTL 60s)
    FetchingTicket --> Disconnected : Session invalid (redirect /sign-in)

    Connecting --> Connected : 101 Switching Protocols + connection.ready
    Connecting --> Disconnected : Handshake error / Origin denied

    state Connected {
        [*] --> Idle
        Idle --> SendingMessage : User dispatches text
        SendingMessage --> Idle : message.ack received
        Idle --> ReceivingMessage : message.created received
        ReceivingMessage --> Delivering : Dispatch client message.delivered ACK
        Delivering --> Idle : ACK sent
        Idle --> ReadingMessage : Visible for >= 500ms
        ReadingMessage --> Idle : message.read sent
        Idle --> Heartbeating : 30s ping timer
        Heartbeating --> Idle : pong received within 10s
    }

    Connected --> Reconnecting : Network loss / ping timeout / 1001 close
    Reconnecting --> FetchingTicket : Exponential backoff with full jitter
    Connected --> Disconnected : Explicit user sign-out
